/* Internal name: vx1000_FlashPrepareLoop                                                                                     */
/* Classic API:   VX1000_DETECT_FKL_REQUESTS                                                                                  */
/* Wrapper API:   VX1000If_DetectFklRequests                                                                                  */
/* Return value:  None                                                                                                        */
/* Parameter1:    None                                                                                                        */
