/*                   payload nor call VX1000_DATATRANSFER_FINISH                                                              */
/* Parameter1:    Selector for the status type of interest { VX1000_DAQ_TYPE_XCP, VX1000_DAQ_TYPE_RADARRAWDATA,               */
/*                VX1000_DAQ_TYPE_CMP, VX1000_DAQ_TYPE_UNDEF }                                                                */
/* Parameter2:    A 64bit timestamp whose low 32 bits must match the value of VX1000_CLOCK()                                  */
/* Parameter3:    The destination address of the transfer                                                                     */
