/* Preemption:    This function should not be interrupted by vx1000_DataTransferStart() or vx1000_DataTransferFinish().       */
/*                This function should not interrupt vx1000_DataTransferStart() or vx1000_DataTransferFinish().               */
/* Termination:   No problem                                                                                                  */
/* Precondition1: vx1000_InitAsyncStart() must have been called.                                                              */
